uccessfactors.md","line":437},{"title":"ServiceNow Store","target":"https://store.servicenow.com/","line":507},{"title":"Request SaaS License Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/request-saas-license-management.md","line":513},{"title":"Application Manager","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/application-manager.md","line":513},{"title":"using Software Asset Workspace","target":"using-sam-workspace","line":517},{"title":"Software Asset Workspace","target":"sam-workspace","line":544},{"title":"Minimal user permissions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-workfront.md","line":594},{"title":"step 14","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-successfactors.md","line":653},{"title":"software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":726},{"title":"Subscription exclusions for SaaS and SSO applications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/subscription-exclusions.md","line":738},{"title":"Create a child alias to set up multiple integration profiles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/create-child-alias-saas.md","line":740},{"title":"Review a software reclamation rule","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/add-reclamation-rule-sub.md","line":744},{"title":"Create entitlements in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/track-software-rights.md","line":748},{"title":"Create entitlements in workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/create-entitlements-workspace.md","line":749},{"title":"Create entitlements using the guided walk-through","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/guidedwalk-workspace.md","line":750},{"title":"License Workbench","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-license-workbench.md","line":752},{"title":"License usage view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-workspace-workbench.md","line":752},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/t_RunReconciliation.md","line":754},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in the workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/run-recon-workspace.md","line":755},{"title":"Software Asset Management","target":"c_SoftwareAssetMgmt","line":759},{"title":"SaaS License Management","target":"sam-subscription-management","line":760},{"title":"Using Software Asset Workspace","target":"using-sam-workspace","line":761},{"title":"Software Asset Workspace","target":"sam-workspace","line":762},{"title":"Software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":763}],"metadata":{"title":"Integrating with SAP SuccessFactors","description":"Integrating your Software Asset Management application with the SAP SuccessFactors application enables you to track your software subscriptions and to reclaim unused licenses.Set up basic authentication to enable access to the SAP SuccessFactors API.Create a connection between your SAP SuccessFactors OData API and your ServiceNow instance.Enable client certificate authentication for the outbound communication from SAP Master Data service by generating the keystore.jks and keystore.cer files.Enable client certificate authentication for the outbound communication by uploading the JKS certificate in your ServiceNow instance.Use the API key generated during the client application configuration to register the application as an OAuth provider.Create a SAML2 assertion record to generate the SAML2 assertion and exchange the assertion for the access tokens with the provider.Create a connection record for the OData API in SuccessFactors. The SuccessFactors spoke connection and credential alias uses these connections to perform actions in SuccessFactors.Create a connection record for the OData API in SuccessFactors. The SuccessFactors spoke connection and credential alias uses these connections to perform actions in SuccessFactors.Create an SAP SuccessFactors integration profile to track software subscriptions and optimize licensing for your SAP SuccessFactors applications.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-successfactors.html","release":"australia","product":"SaaS License Management","classification":"saas-license-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":22,"breadcrumb":["Integrate with SaaS applications","SaaS License Management","Software Asset Management","IT Asset Management"],"tags":["#it-asset-management","#saas","#license-management","#discovery","#optimization","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-with-successfactors.md"},
